    "Ka daa xidhiidhka maran si aad u hesho muuqaal cad oo aan la gujin karin.",
  "Less refunds": "lacag celin yar",
  "Lets customers apply a gift card code at checkout, covering part or all of their order total. Issue cards from the Gift Cards page. Off by default — existing cards and their balances are kept, just not redeemable, while this is off.":
    "Waxay u ogolaataa macaamiishu inay codsadaan koodka kaadhka hadyada marka ay baxayaan, daboolaya qayb ama dhammaan dalabkooda. Ka soo saar kaararka hadiyadda bogga. Demin si caadi ah - kaadhadhka jira iyo hadhaagooda waa la hayaa, kaliya maaha kuwo la soo furan karo, inta ay tani maqan tahay.",
  "Lets customers narrow the shop grid by dietary tag (Vegan, Gluten Free, ...) and certification. Reads tags and certifications already assigned to products in the product editor — off just hides the filter checkboxes, nothing assigned is lost.":
    "Waxay u ogolaataa macaamiisha inay ku soo koobaan xayndaabka dukaanka iyagoo isticmaalaya sumad cunto (Vegan, Gluten Free, ...) iyo shahaado. Wuxuu akhriyaa tags iyo shahaadooyin horay loogu qoondeeyay badeecada tafatiraha alaabta - off kaliya waxay qarinaysaa sanduuqyada hubinta, ma jiraan wax loo qoondeeyay lumay.",
  "Lets customers set up recurring cash-on-delivery deliveries of a product from its product page. Off by default and not needed at launch — existing subscriptions are kept and viewable in Subscriptions, just not renewed, while this is off.":
    "U oggolow macaamiishu inay dejiyaan soo-dejinta lacagta caddaanka ah ee soo noqnoqota ee alaabta ee boggeeda alaabta. Demin si caadi ah oo aan loo baahnayn marka la bilaabayo - Diiwaangelinta hadda jirta waa la hayaa oo lagu arki karaa Rukunsiyada, kaliya lama cusboonaysiin, inta tani maqan tahay.",
